# Delight Cafe — Netlify database
#
# Login works automatically using SQLite fallback in the Netlify Function
# (no env vars required for basic login/register).
#
# For durable cloud MySQL (recommended for production), set:
#   MYSQL_HOST=...
#   MYSQL_PORT=3306
#   MYSQL_USER=...
#   MYSQL_PASSWORD=...
#   MYSQL_DATABASE=delight_cafe
#   SESSION_SECRET=any-long-random-string
#
# Or:
#   DATABASE_URL=mysql://user:pass@host:3306/delight_cafe
#
# After changing env vars: Redeploy the site.
# Test: https://YOUR-SITE.netlify.app/api/health
# Default logins: admin/admin123 and user/password
